socat is the data-path workhorse for the egress module: it listens on
127.0.0.1:51820/udp and forwards every datagram to the backend address rendered
into the egress systemd unit. It was chosen over an in-house Python relay
because it is a long-standing, single-binary, well-audited tool with no
equivalent in the standard library.

